  "details": "When selecting a user and looking at them in the quickmenu, you can go through all users using the arrow buttons at the top right. The menu buttons shift once you get to your own profile, due to the menu hiding the report button (as you cannot report yourself). So when using the buttons you can easily click the report button or go back and forth between yourself and someone. => To solve this issue the report button should be the leftmost button, such that the right alligned button row doesn't move when switching through users. (or just hide the report button and not move the arrow buttons i guess)",
